      ***************************************************************
      * FILE NAME : MCFLARPO23
      * FILE TYPE : LOGICAL  FILE
      *
      * PURPOSE   : ARIBA PO DETAIL BY REQ NUMBER - GOODYEAR COPY
      *             SELECT ONLY HEADERS AND KEY ON REQNO
      *                         ----------------
      *             USED TO SHOW REQ'S SENT TO ARIBA NOT BACK YET
      *
      * CREATED   : 11/21/2002
      * AUTHOR    : EXLTECH, INC - DAN RAUCH
      *
      ***************************************************************
      * SPECIAL NOTES: THIS LOGICAL USED IN QUERY PO2DQRY TO LIST
      *                DIFFERENCE BETWEEN REQLOG AND PO DTL COPY2.
      *                WHEN REQLOG IS PRIMARY FILE AND THERE IS NO
      *                MATCHING REQNO IN PO DTL COPY2, THIS MISMATCH
      *                REPRESENTS REQ'S SENT TO ARIBA THAT HAVEN'T
      *                COME BACK YET.
      ***************************************************************
     A          R MCFRARPO2D                PFILE(MCFPARPO2D)
     A            ARBRECIND          I
     A            ARBREQNO           I      SST(ARBRECIFO 1 12)
     A          K ARBREQNO
     A          S ARBRECIND                 COMP(EQ '1')
